	GMOS COMPONENTS CONTROLLER SOURCE CODE DIRECTORY
	================================================

This directory contains the C code and header files for the GMOS Instrument
Sequencer and Components Controller software. The following files are
contained:

Instrument Sequencer Header files
----------------------------------
gmSeq.h               - All definitions for instrument sequencer

Instrument Sequencer C code
---------------------------
dbMatchField.c        - Utility to search for all record fields
                        with a particular value (engineering only).
gmSeqCadLib.c         - All the functions implementing the high level
                        CAD commands.
gmSeqDisplayMenus.c   - Functions for generating arrays of strings
                        used to populate the filter, grating and mask
                        name menus. (Only present to make the "dm"
                        screens easier to use).
gmSeqLib.c            - All the general purpose functions.
gmSeqTracking.c       - All the functions relating to AtmDC tracking
                        and flexure control.


Components Controller Header files
----------------------------------
darMessageLevels.h   - Message type definitions for assembly level software
devAssControl.h      - General device support entry table for assemblyControl
                       record software.
devDeviceControl.h   - Device support entry tables for deviceControl record.
drvOmsVme.h          - Constants and function definitions for OMS-VME8/44 motor
                       control device driver.
gmOiwfsCalc.h        - Global variables and definitions for OIWFS calculation
                       functions
gmosCcCadLib.h       - Function definitions for GMOS components controller CAD
                       functions.
gmosLutLib.h         - Global variables and definitions for lookup table
                       functions.
lifter.h             - Constants for the GMOS grating lifter
recAssControl.h      - Constants and data structures for assemblyControl record
                       software.
recDeviceControl.h   - Constants and data structures for deviceControl record
                       software.
tcs_simulator.h      - Function definitions for OIWFS TCS simulator.


Components Controller C code
----------------------------
devApplyLocal.c      - Private copy of the local device support for apply
                       record developed by Chris Mayer.
devApplyRemote.c     - Private copy of the remote device support for apply
                       record developed by Chris Mayer. This works between two
                       IOCs.
devAtmdcControl.c    - Assembly record device support for the AtmDC assembly.
devBarcode.c         - Barcode reader driver software.
devDeviceControl.c   - Universal device support for the deviceControl record.
                       All devices use this device support.
devFilterAss.c       - Assembly record device support for the filter assembly.
devGratingAss.c      - Assembly record device support for the grating
                       assembly.
devMaskControl.c     - Assembly record device support for the mask assembly.
devOiwfsControl.c    - Assembly record device support for the OIWFS assembly.
devTranslationAss.c  - Assembly record device support for the detector
                       translation assembly.
drvOmsVme.c          - Driver software for the OMS-VME8 and OMS-VME44 motor
                       control cards. All devices use this driver.
gmMaskGenSubs.c      - Gensub functions used by the mask assembly.
gmOiwfsCadSupport.c  - CAD record functions used by the OIWFS software.
gmOiwfsCalc.c        - Calculation functions used by the OIWFS software.
gmOiwfsCalibrate.c   - Calibration functions used by the OIWFS software.
gmOiwfsGenSubs.c     - Gensub functions used by the OIWFS software.
gmosCcCadLib.c       - General CAD functions used by the GMOS components
                       controller.
gmosGensubLib.c      - General gensub functions used by the GMOS components
                       controller.
gmosLutLib.c         - General purpose lookup table handling functions.
lifter.c             - GMOS grating lifter control software.
mult.c               - Multiplication function used by test scripts in
                       gmoscc/test.
rand.c               - Random number generator used by test scripts in
                       gmoscc/test.
recApply.c           - Private copy of the record support for the apply record
                       developed by Chris Mayer.
recAssControl.c      - Record support for the assemblyControl record.
recDeviceControl.c   - Record support for the deviceControl record.
rngShow.c            - Utility function for displaying ther contents of a
                       ring buffer (engineering only).
tcs_simulator.c      - TCS simulator used by OIWFS software.
testOms844.c         - Utility functions for testing the OMS-VME8 and OMS-VME44
                       motor control cards (engineering only).
tolower.c            - Lowercase function used by test scripts in gmoscc/test.


Components Controller EPICS state notation language
---------------------------------------------------
assemblyCar.stpp     - Copies the state changes from the BUSY field of an
                       assembly record to the IVAL field of a CAR record
                       without forcing the two records into the same lock
                       set.
commandCar.stpp      - Manages the probeC CAR record for the OIWFS software.
dtaAssemblyCar.stpp  - Manages the CAR record for an assembly, in a similar
                       way to assemblyCar.stpp, except the control is
                       switched off during periods when the assembly is in
                       a tracking mode.
lifterSim.stpp       - A simulator for the GMOS grating lifter. DO NOT LOAD
                       UNLESS OPERATING GMOS IN SIMULATION MODE.
softCar.stpp         - Manages the CAR records associated with trivial GMOS
                       commands.
systemCar.stpp       - Manages the CAR records associated with GMOS system
                       commands, where the activation of a CAD record makes
                       the CAR go BUSY but the CAR does not go IDLE until
                       all the GMOS assemblies are IDLE.
